  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Financial Model Kosovo</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Finansiell Modell Kosovo</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sida avser att finansiera uppbyggnaden av finansiella system p&#xE5; kommunal niv&#xE5; i Kosovo. Ett viktigt steg innan projektf&#xF6;rslaget utarbetas &#xE4;r att UNMIK tar fram en s.k. finansiell modell. F&#xF6;r att st&#xF6;dja denna processen kommer Sida att delfinansiera en Habitat mission som &#xE4;r upphandlad f&#xF6;r att ta fram Kosovos finansiella modell.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida intends to support financial systems at the municipal level in Kosovo. An important step before the project is designed is for UNMIK to develop a &quot;financial model&quot;. To facilitate this process Sida will co-fund a Habitat mission that is commissioned to develop the &quot;financial model&quot; for Kosovo.</narrative>
  </description>
